            </note>
            <note corresp="#d539-f2" n="64" xml:id="d539-f2-content">
                <p>Virgil Madgearu, Minister of Finance.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d539-f3" n="65" xml:id="d539-f3-content">
                <p>William C. Bullitt, Executive Officer of the American delegation.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d539-f4" n="66" xml:id="d539-f4-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 125, July 12, 5 p.m., from the Chairman of the American delegation;
                    not printed.</p>
            </note>
